      "timestamp_sec": 636,
      "why": "Frames local agent security as a forced choice between toil and hope — a clear tradeoff statement."
    },
    {
      "text": "it finds a token on your laptop that it can use and it thinks it's working with staging, but actually it's production and now it just deleted everything.",
      "timestamp_sec": 665,
