    },
    {
      "text": "the last thing I'll mention about that is that this is the key for allowing your non-technical team members to trigger real work.",
      "timestamp_sec": 709,
      "why": "Links the infrastructure choice to the organizational payoff, the talk's thesis in miniature."
    },
    {
      "text": "And the last lesson is to benchmark agents on your code base.",
      "timestamp_sec": 783,
